# StructureStudio runs scripts/preflight.mjs here, because nothing in that repo compiles
# ahead of time and a broken reference ships silently to a customer's tab. This repo has
# no pre-push correctness gate yet. If you add one (lint / typecheck / tests), first
# confirm it passes clean on the branch tip: a gate that fails on day one makes the repo
# unpushable and teaches everyone to reach for --no-verify, which is worse than no gate.
